<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><documents xmlns:xsi = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation = "HDocumentSchema.xsd"><document type = "H"><pnldref>H2667</pnldref><english><title>Attempt to send a false / misleading wireless message ship / aircraft in distress</title><additionalkeywords><additionalkeyword>TRANSMISSION</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>TRANSMITTED</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>TRANSMISSIONS</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>TRANSMITS</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>FALSE</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>SENT</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>SENDING</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>BROADCASTED</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>WIRELESS TELEGRAPHY ACT 1949</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>ATTEMPT</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>ATTEMPTING</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>ATTEMPTED</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>RIPA</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>SAFETY</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>SAFE</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>PERSON</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>VESSEL</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>AIRCRAFT</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>DISTRESS</additionalkeyword><additionalkeyword>ASSISTANCE</additionalkeyword></additionalkeywords><standardoffencewording>On **(..SPECIFY DATE..) at **(..SPECIFY TOWNSHIP..) by means of wireless telegraphy, attempted to send a message, namely **(..SPECIFY MESSAGE..), which to your knowledge, was&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;(A)_[false]_&lt;br /&gt;(B)_[misleading]_&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;and was, to your knowledge, likely to &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;(C)_[prejudice the efficiency of a safety of life service]_&lt;br /&gt;(D)_[endanger the safety of a person]_&lt;br /&gt;(E)_[endanger the safety of a vessel]_&lt;br /&gt;(F)_[endanger the safety of an aircraft]_&lt;br /&gt;(F)_[endanger the safety of a vehicle]_&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;and, in particular, by falsely suggesting that&lt;br /&g